影风格不统一，肢体扭曲，多手多脚，人体比例失调，画面拼接痕迹，背景杂乱，多余杂物，文字水印，模糊低清，噪点过重，过曝欠曝，夸张表情，非全身人像，人物大小不一致"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [36], "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "color": "#323", "shape": 2, "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt1", "link": 19, "label": "提示词1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "prompt2", "link": 20, "label": "提示词2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt2"}, {"widget": {"name": "separator"}, "shape": 7, "name": "separator", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "间隔符"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptConcat", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [257.15557861328125, 78], "pos": [1389.9515380859375, 1016.9072265625], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptConcat"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [34], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [277.6698913574219, 429.6304626464844], "pos": [1087.3438720703125, 532.3563842773438], "widgets_values": ["pasted/398cc31ad7ead01d2d274fd773f82b8567c2436c4c51858a2b8878992655edaf.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE"